{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-037",
    "title": "最后一盏引路灯"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_232",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“别替我决定。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟盟总坛的石门只撑了半刻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6694,
          "end": 6694
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光从门缝中渗入，先覆盖石阶，再爬上墙壁。墙上悬挂的旧盟约一张张鼓起，像纸下有手在推动。归墟盟主将黑色水池掀翻，池水化作一道墨墙，暂时挡住光潮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6696,
          "end": 6696
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总坛不能再留。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6698,
          "end": 6698
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去哪里？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6700,
          "end": 6700
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主指向石厅尽头：“天门之下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6702,
          "end": 6702
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见那里原本是一面石墙。墙面被青光照过后，浮出一扇向下的门，门上没有锁，只有三枚凹槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6704,
          "end": 6704
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印、铜环、无相镜。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6706,
          "end": 6706
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜环放进第二个凹槽，慧闻把无相铜镜放进第三个。陆照临把融合后的灰白圆盘按入第一个凹槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6708,
          "end": 6708
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石门向下开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6710,
          "end": 6710
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "阶梯一直延伸到地底，四周没有灯，却有无数名字从石壁里透出微光。每走一步，便有一个名字在耳边轻声念出，声音来自不同年龄、不同地域的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6712,
          "end": 6712
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听见一个陌生女孩说：“我叫许秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6714,
          "end": 6714
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "又听见一个老人说：“我叫沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6716,
          "end": 6716
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "再往下，是顾氏旁支一串被削掉的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6718,
          "end": 6718
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里保存的是所有被放弃的名字？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6720,
          "end": 6720
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是保存。”慧闻说，“是等待归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6722,
          "end": 6722
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟主：“你早知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6724,
          "end": 6724
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道总坛下面有门，不知道门后是名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6726,
          "end": 6726
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着倒置城中数不清的灯：“所以那些人一直被困在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6752,
          "end": 6752
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们不是被困。”归墟盟主说，“他们是支撑世界的材料。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6754,
          "end": 6754
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“材料也有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6756,
          "end": 6756
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "倒置城内忽然响起钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6758,
          "end": 6758
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一座石楼从城墙上脱落，落入空洞底部。石楼碎裂后，露出里面密密麻麻的灯芯。每根灯芯上都刻着一个姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6760,
          "end": 6760
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看到一根灯芯上的字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6762,
          "end": 6762
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6764,
          "end": 6764
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他冲向倒置城门。城门却在他靠近前闭合，门缝中传来陆沉舟的声音：“这里不是我的家。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6766,
          "end": 6766
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你为什么不出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6768,
          "end": 6768
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人要留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6770,
          "end": 6770
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6772,
          "end": 6772
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有还没有被记住的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6774,
          "end": 6774
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住门面，金丹中的青色纹路立刻暴涨。门内灯芯同时点燃，倒置城的街道变成一片火海。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6776,
          "end": 6776
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相镜：“别打开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6778,
          "end": 6778
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我能把他们带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6780,
          "end": 6780
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只能把一部分带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6782,
          "end": 6782
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一部分也好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6784,
          "end": 6784
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那剩下的呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6786,
          "end": 6786
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6788,
          "end": 6788
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到他身边，将铜环贴在城门上。铜环内侧浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6790,
          "end": 6790
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏经手人，第三次点灯未完成。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6792,
          "end": 6792
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我叔父来过这里。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6794,
          "end": 6794
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他没有离开。”叶观澜看着城内。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6796,
          "end": 6796
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我去找他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6798,
          "end": 6798
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会成为第四个经手人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6800,
          "end": 6800
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头：“如果没人接灯，灯会继续找别人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6802,
          "end": 6802
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主忽然取出一枚黑色令牌，令牌上刻着归墟盟主印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6804,
          "end": 6804
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我可以打开城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6806,
          "end": 6806
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6808,
          "end": 6808
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让我成为新的门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6810,
          "end": 6810
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人同时看向他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6812,
          "end": 6812
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要替他们承担？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6814,
          "end": 6814
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我继承了改写权，也继承了改写的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6816,
          "end": 6816
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会失去什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6818,
          "end": 6818
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字、记忆和归墟盟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6820,
          "end": 6820
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜握紧刀：“不行。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6822,
          "end": 6822
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是盟主。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6824,
          "end": 6824
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可我是叶观澜。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6826,
          "end": 6826
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬刀劈向黑色令牌。令牌裂成两半，归墟盟主的脸色第一次变得难看。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6828,
          "end": 6828
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你拒绝继承？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6830,
          "end": 6830
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我拒绝替你决定谁该被牺牲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6832,
          "end": 6832
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "地下空洞开始震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6834,
          "end": 6834
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门的裂缝从倒置城上方延伸下来，贯穿地底与天空。裂缝尽头浮出一盏巨大的灯，灯火照亮整个空洞。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6836,
          "end": 6836
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见灯下站着陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6838,
          "end": 6838
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，父亲的脸清晰完整。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6840,
          "end": 6840
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，”他说，“第四条路还在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6842,
          "end": 6842
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6894,
          "end": 6894
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会失去修为？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6938,
          "end": 6938
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“从此无法再凝聚新的灵气。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6940,
          "end": 6940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“你还可以停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6942,
          "end": 6942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头看他：“你已经结丹了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6944,
          "end": 6944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不代表你必须付出代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6946,
          "end": 6946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人点灯，所有人都要付出。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6948,
          "end": 6948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她拔出心口铜针，血珠没有落地，反而沿着地面旧印流向灯海深处。每经过一座熄灭的灯柱，便有一个名字从石壁中浮出。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6950,
          "end": 6950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听见无数陌生人低声说话。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6952,
          "end": 6952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6954,
          "end": 6954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不想再回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6956,
          "end": 6956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我的孩子在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6958,
          "end": 6958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别替我决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6960,
          "end": 6960
        }
      }
    ],
